msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p><p>A "
"visualização <strong><em>@type</em></strong> do Editoria11y está ausente.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p><p>Este módulo instala três configurações de visualização, "
"encontradas na pasta /config/install. Todas precisam ser instaladas para que "
"o dashboard exiba resultados.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p><p>Para corrigir: copie e cole o conteúdo de <strong>/"
"editoria11y/config/install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> em uma "
"importação do tipo “View” em <a href=\"/admin/config/development/"
"configuration/single/import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/"
"import</a>. Se você sincroniza configurações com o filesystem, inclua essas "
"Views no repositório.</p>"

